<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is dispatching troops to Saudi Arabia to fight the Houthis while publicly denying any deployment in Yemen. Syrian forces killed the leader of an armed cell in Tartus and the interior minister is reviewing security priorities in the Damascus countryside. Jordan and Syria have signed eleven cooperation agreements covering economic projects, security coordination and a rail link, deepening bilateral ties. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1kT0hrVVhCMEQ4OUNibEdZemp1RmNhamxDeUljQ0IwNUstQzdLUXdQQ2g4NVdtWm12SDJXcUl2dlFqQ2tmRFJ3aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNdk5WdE5XRjRnZjRjR2FRbHhZX2lPSlZYMXdUSlJKdUhlak1zMUN3TV94Y2VRUldjcVFWSGZxcFdBU0VweFViOGFUSWUxaFcwalhiMzFqWDVrNjNNbzk1UmJjUExZNzdSbjBQazJzMnBCU3RhSnVDWndzV0w5VUJQYVhmanB4ZEtGcFViQndQXzVOdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTFBPc3hOVWR3THdyVzhhTjVyeDFRUEliQV9sS0JEa2c1NDZBUmZCcmxuVTU3SG9MZDBLRjNiZXhFeGdHd0ZGU1ozbGFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;المرصد السوري لحقوق الإنسان&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNbFdfVlJlVGdaUDlxbGRfQUx3YnZ3dVVXdWJPbHMyNG9NZkFCcFNPVEZMUnA2aktjVEFoRXNFOHFyYmNpRzljN1VGRlJ1a2FQWjgzRy0tZnlkQTBpaEl1dFJrbDVYOXhuQ1dMbnRTeGdtNmd2TkF2YURwMmMtcENEVExRYVR2YUF2RjRnbzlRdUthTnd3cktZeTlJdXU3SzdfNEQwNVp2MUlYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNUGdlU